<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Secunderabad</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Secunderabad is the twin city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hyderabad">Hyderabad</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/telangana">Telangana</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a>, named after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sikandar-lodi">Sikandar</a> Jah, the third Nizam. It grew around the British cantonment established there in the early 19th century under the subsidiary alliance, which housed the troops that guaranteed the Nizam's security, and remains a large military station.</p></div>
